### 2 cli query relative.wtf [length(entries), length(diagnostics)] --json
$ wtf query relative.wtf [length(entries), length(diagnostics)] --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T00:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[
  3,
  0
]

### 3 cli query relative.wtf import("agenda").between(entries, today(), today()) | select title --json
$ wtf query relative.wtf import("agenda").between(entries, today(), today()) | select title --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T00:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[
  "Coffee"
]

### 4 cli query cycle.wtf diagnostics | select {line, severity, message} --json
$ wtf query cycle.wtf diagnostics | select {line, severity, message} --json --root <root> --now 2026-09-16T00:00:00-04:00
exit 0
--- stdout
[
  {
    "line": 0,
    "message": "Task dependency cycle: a → b → a",
    "severity": "error"
  },
  {
    "line": 1,
    "message": "Task dependency cycle: b → a → b",
    "severity": "error"
  }
]

